        "TileImage": "$($repository 43207611-7c6e-4b98-8b52-5a84915ade5b).Image",
        "Description": "Helmut Kruger is a well-travelled man with many connections to high places.\rThis made him a target for the FSB, who blackmail and use him and his access to the global elite.\r\rYour job is to get Kruger out. His handler, Alex Vladimir, is supposed to make another drop off during the fashion show in Paris. Kill her and her contacts. Show your best! We want Kruger to trust and work with us, so show him what a true professional looks like.",
